menu "WiSense FSR (pressure sensor)"

    config WISENSE_FSR_GPIO
        int "FSR analog signal GPIO"
        default 34
        help
            ADC1 input for the FSR406 voltage divider (e.g. GPIO34 on ESP32 DevKit).
            GPIO32/33/34/35/36/39 are ADC1-capable on ESP32.

    config WISENSE_FSR_PRESS_THRESHOLD
        int "Raw ADC threshold to enter \"on bed\" (0-4095)"
        range 0 4095
        default 1500
        help
            Smoothed FSR reading at or above this value enters the pressed
            state. Tune with idf.py monitor while pressing the sensor.

    config WISENSE_FSR_RELEASE_THRESHOLD
        int "Raw ADC threshold to exit \"on bed\" (0-4095)"
        range 0 4095
        default 1200
        help
            Smoothed FSR reading at or below this value exits the pressed
            state. Must be lower than the press threshold — this gap
            (hysteresis) is what stops chatter for a reading that sits
            right at the boundary.

endmenu
